flowchart TD
    A["Patient says the limb is weak"] --> B{"Is it pain, true weakness, or both?"}
    B -->|"Pain stops the effort"| C["Looks weak because it hurts<br/>think joint, tendon, muscle"]
    B -->|"True weakness"| D{"Objective sensory change?"}
    D -->|No| E["MUSCLE OR TENDON (MSK)<br/>e.g. ruptured Achilles, rotator cuff degeneration"]
    D -->|Yes| F{"Tone and reflexes?"}
    F -->|"Tone up, reflexes brisk, Babinski present"| G["UPPER MOTOR NEURON<br/>brain or spinal cord"]
    F -->|"Tone normal or low, reflexes reduced"| H["LOWER MOTOR NEURON<br/>root or peripheral nerve"]

flowchart TD
    A["Back or neck pain"] --> B{"Any red flags?"}
    B -->|Yes| C["Investigate the worry now<br/>X-ray: fracture, malignancy<br/>MRI: neurological compromise, infection, tumour<br/>+ targeted blood work or cultures"]
    B -->|No| D{"Present under 6 weeks?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["NO IMAGING<br/>conservative care"]
    D -->|"No - worse or no better after 6 weeks of conservative care"| F["Image<br/>MRI is the best test<br/>CT only if MRI is contraindicated or unavailable"]

flowchart TD
    A["Shoulder pain or stiffness"] --> B{"Where, and what happened?"}
    B -->|"Top of the shoulder, tender AC joint<br/>worse reaching across the chest"| C["AC JOINT<br/>gradual = arthritis · injury = separation"]
    B -->|"Slipped out or dislocated"| D{"Trauma?"}
    D -->|Yes| E["TRAUMATIC INSTABILITY<br/>usually anterior · torn loose<br/>reduce ± surgery"]
    D -->|No| F["ATRAUMATIC INSTABILITY<br/>multidirectional · born loose<br/>physiotherapy"]
    B -->|"Deep aching or stiffness"| G{"Passive range of motion?"}
    G -->|"Passive better than active"| H["INFLAMMATORY ARTHRITIS<br/>weak rotator cuff<br/>symmetric joint space, erosions, osteopenia"]
    G -->|"Passive lost as well"| I{"X-ray?"}
    I -->|"Osteophytes, asymmetric joint space"| J["OSTEOARTHRITIS<br/>rotator cuff strength good"]
    I -->|"Normal"| K["ADHESIVE CAPSULITIS<br/>diagnosis of exclusion"]

flowchart TD
    A["Shoulder pain"] --> B{"Pain and tenderness right at the<br/>acromioclavicular (AC) joint?"}
    B -->|"Yes, after a fall or blow"| C["AC JOINT SEPARATION<br/>grade it by displacement (types 1-6)"]
    B -->|"Yes, gradual, reaching across the chest"| D["AC JOINT ARTHRITIS"]
    B -->|No| E{"Humeral head slipping out of the socket?"}
    E -->|Yes| F["INSTABILITY<br/>traumatic or atraumatic?"]
    E -->|No| G{"Is passive motion lost too?"}
    G -->|"No - active worse than passive"| H{"Rotator cuff strength and X-ray"}
    H -->|"Impingement signs · weak cuff · X-ray normal"| I["ROTATOR CUFF DISEASE"]
    H -->|"Weak cuff · symmetric joint space loss, erosions"| J["INFLAMMATORY ARTHRITIS"]
    G -->|"Yes - active and passive both lost"| K{"X-ray"}
    K -->|"Asymmetric joint space loss, osteophytes"| L["DEGENERATIVE ARTHRITIS"]
    K -->|"Normal, no trauma"| M["ADHESIVE CAPSULITIS<br/>a diagnosis of exclusion"]
